nSpam=!nSpam;nStat.textContent=nSpam?'ВКЛ':'ВЫКЛ';
if(nSpam)nInt=setInterval(()=>{for(let n of activeNums)fire(n)},50);else clearInterval(nInt);
}else if(e.shiftKey&&e.code==='KeyF'){
e.preventDefault();e.stopPropagation();
holdK();
}
},true);
